# Profile / Identity Settings — Major Overhaul

Polish and upgrade the profile settings page (`app/profile/page.tsx`) with new features, better UX, and premium aesthetics, making it a state-of-the-art customization experience.

## What Already Exists (Keeping)
- ✅ Identity section (display name, status, bio)
- ✅ Avatar upload with live preview  
- ✅ Theme presets (6) + custom color pickers
- ✅ Background (URL, tiling, opacity)
- ✅ Profile Anthem (theme track URL)
- ✅ Vibes (read-only trust/cool/sexy bars)
- ✅ Live ProfileCard 3D preview
- ✅ Stats strip (posts, influence, tier)
- ✅ ThemeEngine integration
- ✅ Save button with loading/success states

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Navigation & Layout Upgrade

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///t:/zeezu/app/profile/page.tsx)

**Tabbed sections** — Replace the single long scroll with tab navigation for cleaner organization. Tabs will include:
- **Identity** — Name, status, bio, avatar (existing)
- **Appearance** — Theme presets, colors, background (existing)
- **Social Links** — New links section (website, Twitter/X, Instagram, GitHub, Discord, custom)
- **Privacy** — Visibility toggles for profile sections
- **Account** — Email display, sign out, danger zone (delete account)

This keeps the live ProfileCard preview pinned on the left at all times.

---

### 2. New Features

#### Social Links Section (NEW)
- Add 6 link fields: Website, X/Twitter, Instagram, GitHub, Discord, Custom
- Each with icon, URL input, and live preview on public profile
- Stored in `users` table columns or a new `social_links` JSONB column

#### Privacy & Visibility Section (NEW)
- Toggle: Show/hide vibes scores on public profile
- Toggle: Show/hide wall posts on public profile  
- Toggle: Allow anyone to post on wall vs friends-only
- Toggle: Show online status
- Stored in `users` or `profile_customization` table

#### Profile Completeness Meter (NEW)
- Visual progress bar showing profile completion %
- Checks: display name, avatar, bio, status, theme, social links, anthem
- Encouraging micro-copy for each incomplete item

#### Account Actions (NEW)
- Display email (read-only)
- Sign out button  
- Change password (link to Supabase auth)

---

### 3. UX Polish

#### Animated Tab Transitions
- Smooth slide animation when switching between tabs
- Active tab indicator with animated underline

#### Unsaved Changes Warning
- Track dirty state across all fields
- Show "Unsaved changes" floating indicator
- Warn before navigating away via `beforeunload` event

#### Per-Section Save Feedback
- Each section card gets a subtle border glow when modified
- Save button pulses when there are unsaved changes

#### Input Improvements
- Character counters on all text fields (display name 30/30, bio 500/500, status 140/140)
- URL validation with visual feedback for theme track and background URLs
- Avatar: show file size and accept/reject feedback

